    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Realm of Gods\" Category allies' Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g},\nplus an additional Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters\nwho are also Super Class\n- Extreme Class enemies' ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:down_y}\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When there is another \"Realm of Gods\" Category ally attacking\nin the same turn*\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g} when receiving an attack\n- High chance of performing a critical hit\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n*When there are 3 Super Class allies attacking in the same turn,\nor when there is an Extreme Class enemy*\n- ATK 200%{passiveImg:up_g} when attacking\n- Great chance of stunning the attacked enemy for 2 turns\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack when attacking as the 1st or 2nd attacker in a turn\n- ATK & DEF 300%{passiveImg:up_g} when attacking as the 3rd attacker in a turn",
